' ============================================================================
'  intro.cut -- the game opens.
'
'  Played once, before the first level. This is the scene that replaces the
'  old intro.descent text crawl, so it keeps that narration key: any narration
'  pack that already voices `intro.descent` voices this too, unchanged.
' ============================================================================

scene intro
storybook "The Descent" "How every run begins."
stage 2112x1632

' ------------------------------------------------------------- the gate
' Open in the dark and bring the gate up out of it, rather than cutting to a
' lit picture: the scene should feel like your eyes adjusting.
cam 0.5,0.62 zoom 1.6
show bg "bg/cut-gate.png" fill at 0.5,0.5
fade to black over 0

music "introsplash" fadein 4.0
fade from black over 2.5

title "DUNGEON!" "nine levels down" for 3.0

' The camera drifts the whole time the narration runs. Six seconds of pan
' under two lines of text costs nothing extra -- that is what `async` is for.
async pan  to 0.5,0.30 over 12.0 ease inout
async zoom to 2.1      over 12.0 ease inout

narrate "intro.descent"
say "They say the stair was cut by something that wanted company."
say "Nine levels. Every one of them deeper than the last."
say "Nobody makes you go down. That is the part people forget."

waitall

' ------------------------------------------------------------ who you are
' The class art is a sprite, not a backdrop, so it sits on its own layer over
' the gate and fades in.
if class == wizard
    show hero "classes/wizard.png" scale 5 at 0.5,0.55 fade 1.2
    say "You go down with a staff and eight spells and no armour at all."
elseif class == elf
    show hero "classes/elf.png" scale 5 at 0.5,0.55 fade 1.2
    say "You go down looking for the doors nobody else can find."
elseif class == superhero
    show hero "classes/superhero.png" scale 5 at 0.5,0.55 fade 1.2
    say "You go down because twenty thousand in gold is a reasonable price."
else
    show hero "classes/hero.png" scale 5 at 0.5,0.55 fade 1.2
    say "You go down with a sword and a lantern, like everyone before you."
end

set seen_intro = 1

crtoff 0.8
